				island of Eubœa</i>, now <i>Cape
			Litar</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 36, 20, 5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mel. 2, 7,
			9</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 12, 21, §
